---
description: Engineer payload is the contract only
---

The prompt-engineer subagent receives the ExecutionContract and, when
the caller set one, `target_model`. It never receives conversation
history, `user_message`, or a raw transcript.

The executor receives `compiled_prompt` and `execution_hints` only.

Render `irreversible_or_external_actions` and `previous_failures` when
present. Put assumptions in their own non-normative section, not under
Done when.
